sequenceDiagram
  participant C as 客户端
  participant O as sessionStorage Outbox
  participant W as WS Handler
  participant S as ChatMessageService
  participant DB as message 表
  C->>O: CHAT_SEND 入队（clientMsgId）
  C->>W: CHAT_SEND
  W->>S: send
  S->>DB: 查 / INSERT（唯一键 conversation+sender+clientMsgId）
  alt 重复
    DB-->>S: 已有消息
    S-->>W: duplicate=true
  else 首次
    DB-->>S: messageId
  end
  W-->>C: CHAT_ACK
  C->>O: 出队
